  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Three days seminar for municipal district heating (DH) companies/cities applying for World Bank loans. The purposed seminar will give project leaders in the cities an update regarding Swedish DH know how relevant to russian DH systems. Aproximately 20 cities compeeting for the loans are expected to attend the seminar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tredagars fj&#xE4;rrv&#xE4;rmeseminarium i Moskva f&#xF6;r &quot;V&#xE4;rldsbanksst&#xE4;der&quot; 25-27 oktober 1999. Det planerade seminariet syftar till att ge projektledarna i de 20 olika delatgande st&#xE4;derna en aktualiserad kunskap om det svenska fj&#xE4;rrv&#xE4;rmesystemet relevant f&#xF6;r det ryska systemet.</narrative>
  </description>
